	(text "AUXILIARY I/O - AIO1 / AIO2 LOW-SIDE DRIVERS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44.196 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0a533767-9826-4448-9dea-8600d9a4b886")
	)
	(text "Each channel is an open-drain (low-side) switch: EXTIOn (3.3V MCU) drives the 2N7002 gate through 1K,\n100K holds it off while the MCU pin is high-Z (reset/boot). AIOn is the drain, brought to the external connector.\n\nRelay use: coil+ to a fused vehicle 12V supply (the board does not source load current), coil- to AIOn.\nSink limit ~100mA per channel (2N7002). AIOn is an output only: the MCU cannot read it back.\n\nTransient protection: PTVS33VS1UTR on each AIO pin, same 33V standoff as the 12V inputs, so a 35V load dump\n(36.7V min breakdown) does not make it conduct. It also clamps relay coil turn-off if no flyback diode is fitted\n(fit one at the relay anyway). The 2N7002 (60V) sits above the TVS clamp. Do not lower the TVS standoff,\nsee PROTECTION.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44.196 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "313c5069-ed4d-4e73-8bc1-ebce0487997f")
	)
